    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists... they just want to patch the cracks so i can keep going in a circle. but that's the thing. i look at the data of my life and it's just a downward slope. there is no recovery from this kind of systemic collapse. it's like i'm just a faulty variable in the equation. if you look at the math, once you reach a certain level of entropy, the only logical end state is zero. you see what i mean?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
